    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="policy-content">

      <div class="policy-intro" id="pp-intro">
        SEA Infonet Pvt. Ltd. ("SEA Infonet", "we", "our", or "us") values the privacy of our customers,
        partners, and website visitors. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your information.
      </div>

      <div class="policy-section" id="pp-1">
        <div class="policy-section-num">Section 01</div>
        <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
        <div class="policy-section-sep"></div>
        <p>We may collect the following information:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Full Name</li>
          <li>Email Address</li>
          <li>Phone Number</li>
          <li>Company Name</li>
          <li>Business-related inquiry information</li>
          <li>Cookies and analytics data</li>
          <li>Browser and device information</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-top:14px;">In future versions of the platform, users may also create accounts and upload files and content.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="policy-section" id="pp-2">
        <div class="policy-section-num">Section 02</div>
        <h2>How We Use Information</h2>
        <div class="policy-section-sep"></div>
        <ul>
          <li>To respond to inquiries and support requests</li>
          <li>To communicate with partners and customers</li>
          <li>To improve website functionality and performance</li>
          <li>To maintain website security</li>
          <li>To analyze traffic and usage patterns</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="policy-section" id="pp-3">
        <div class="policy-section-num">Section 03</div>
        <h2>Cookies &amp; Analytics</h2>
        <div class="policy-section-sep"></div>
        <p>We may use cookies and analytics technologies to improve user experience and understand website traffic. Users can disable cookies through their browser settings.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="policy-section" id="pp-4">
        <div class="policy-section-num">Section 04</div>
        <h2>Information Sharing</h2>
        <div class="policy-section-sep"></div>
        <p>We do not sell or rent personal information to third parties. Information may be shared when required by law or for legitimate business operations.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="policy-section" id="pp-5">
        <div class="policy-section-num">Section 05</div>
        <h2>Data Security</h2>
        <div class="policy-section-sep"></div>
        <p>We implement reasonable security measures to protect your information from unauthorized access, misuse, or disclosure.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="policy-section" id="pp-6">
        <div class="policy-section-num">Section 06</div>
        <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
        <div class="policy-section-sep"></div>
        <p>Currently, we may not actively use third-party services, but future integrations may include:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Analytics tools</li>
          <li>CRM platforms</li>
          <li>Marketing services</li>
          <li>Communication tools</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="policy-section" id="pp-7">
        <div class="policy-section-num">Section 07</div>
        <h2>User Rights</h2>
        <div class="policy-section-sep"></div>
        <p>Users may request access, correction, or deletion of their personal information where applicable under Indian laws.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="policy-section" id="pp-8">
        <div class="policy-section-num">Section 08</div>
        <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <div class="policy-section-sep"></div>
        <p>SEA Infonet Pvt. Ltd. reserves the right to update this Privacy Policy at any time. Continued use of the website constitutes acceptance of any revised policy.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="policy-contact" id="pp-9">
        <div class="policy-section-num">Section 09</div>
        <h2>Contact Information</h2>
        <div class="policy-section-sep"></div>
        <p>For any questions or concerns regarding this Privacy Policy, please reach out to us:</p>
        <p>
          <strong style="color:#f0f8f5;">SEA Infonet Pvt. Ltd.</strong><br>
          Email: <a href="mailto:info@seainfonet.com">info@seainfonet.com</a>
